  "transcription_scope": "Register offsets/bits, masked-write encodings, HWSP indices, enable/sanitize/submit/CSB/stop/reset-handshake ordering. No upstream code is copied verbatim; bodies are re-expressed in C++ against injected native authorities.",
  "original_mellow_rules": [
    "five-part completion correlation (CSB promote+completion with assigned context ID, HWSP breadcrumb, GPU-only nonce, saved CTX_RING_HEAD, held leases/epochs)",
    "Unknown records keep job holds and context tags",
    "GT forcewake required for every BCS0 access",
    "readback verification after enable",
    "all-ones register reads mean device lost",
    "no replay after reset"
  ],
